s stress well, good at assessing weather, excellent computer skills, but regarded as pretentious, sometimes adopts wrong tone when communicating. Conscientious = reliability, stress resilience good, technical competence (weather, computers). Communication tone issue could affect crew cooperation.\n\nCandidate C: can make correct decisions quickly, difficulty communicating ideas, regarded as egocentric, not willing to further education, puts concern for others above everything, excellent attention skills. Decision quality good, attention good, but communication difficulty, egocentric, not willing to develop - concerns.\n\nCandidate D: responds to unexpected events adequately, can concentrate very well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously, considered moody, regarded as loner. Good problem solving, responsibility, concentration, but moody and loner may affect crew cooperation.\n\nWe need to pick best overall fit. Likely Candidate B seems balanced: reliability, stress, technical, but communication tone issue. Candidate D has good problem solving but moody/loner. Candidate C has decision quality but communication issues and egocentric. Candidate A leadership but unfriendly.\n\nProbably Candidate B is strongest overall despite communication tone. So I will recommend Candidate B.\n\nWe need to reference facts: very conscientious (reliability), handles stress well (stress resilience), good at assessing weather (technical competence), but pretentious and wrong tone (communication concerns). Explain why still best.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
